From 7d3587095151c626cb0376d243c142e8a67a20c3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matthew <matthewhale@live.com.au>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 21:21:28 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 01/18] Add widescreen flight view, stretched cockpit, edge HUD
 and laser convergence

- flight.widescreen: the modern flight layer fills the window instead of 4:3
- flight.cockpit_stretch: classic cockpit art and its CRT span the view
- flight.widescreen_hud: cockpit-off radars move out to the screen edges
- flight.laser_convergence: XWA-style player cannon convergence (550 m)
- Video and Game settings expose the options
- Build fix: MinGW mkdir in opt_textures
